http://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/29002788/c1efa17f2cf4b6c099ec8808eb5cb9e2716b4463.png
Oops, looks like someone spilled too much microtransactions! The sinners have already been forbidden to enter the Heaven ;) Our top developers worked day and night anointing themselves with ashes to fix the consequences of that fatal error!

Meet totally reinvented Doodle God Blitz featuring the following:
GLOW is now recharged 5 times faster;
NO PAYWALLS, you play at least half of the game truly for free;
DAILY BONUS with cool hints have been added;
PRICES have been reduced and rebalanced now;
INTERFACE has been polished and is now more convenient;
STABILITY increased for all systems (Windows, Mac, Linux).

Thank you so much for your commentary and criticism!
We prepared a little present for those of you who had a chance to play the previous version and helped us improve it. Just launch the game and start playing ;)

